      "message": "Confirmed intentional and lifecycle-bounded. iOSConnectedCb_ returns true only in the notification extension (Manager::isIOSExtension), whose process is short-lived; the code comment explicitly keeps the id for that extension lifetime. In the long-lived main app it returns false and finalizeIOSCallRequest erases the entry immediately. Thus authenticatedIOSCallRequests_ cannot grow unbounded in a long-lived process with the current callback contract.",
